WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.688
Congratulations!

00:00:00.688 --> 00:00:05.500
You've successfully navigated the world of international

00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:05.945
business.

00:00:05.945 --> 00:00:10.840
You've registered, decided and listed what to sell, and made some

00:00:10.840 --> 00:00:14.666
decisions about how to fulfill and ship your products all over the world.

00:00:14.666 --> 00:00:14.960
Now

00:00:14.960 --> 00:00:19.380
learn about the additional tools, support, and guidance Amazon has to help you

00:00:19.380 --> 00:00:21.228
manage your international sales.

00:00:21.228 --> 00:00:24.000
Selling internationally on Amazon requires you

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:27.600
provide customer support in the native language of that marketplace.

00:00:27.600 --> 00:00:27.960
FBA

00:00:27.960 --> 00:00:31.680
provides direct customer support for all fulfillment related questions in

00:00:31.680 --> 00:00:32.850
the necessary languages.

00:00:32.850 --> 00:00:36.360
Amazon also helps guide your business to make smart

00:00:36.360 --> 00:00:40.680
choices about inventory and ways to optimize your product portfolio as well

00:00:40.680 --> 00:00:44.320
as providing self-service tools for determining your pricing and our

00:00:44.320 --> 00:00:48.240
advertising and marketing tools help you reach customers with targeted ads that

00:00:48.240 --> 00:00:49.872
boost sales and grow your presence.

00:00:49.872 --> 00:00:52.320
We can also help you get paid in the

00:00:52.320 --> 00:00:53.747
currency of your choice.

00:00:53.747 --> 00:00:56.600
Watch as your international business takes off with

00:00:56.600 --> 00:00:57.542
Amazon Global Selling.

00:00:57.542 --> 00:01:00.680
For a list of the products and services available through

